      "substantive": true
    }
  ],
  "notes": "jeanpablojp raised concerns about clock rollover in unit tests (resolved by mocking the clock) and delayed shutdown on idle connections (resolved as pre-existing behavior deferred to a follow-up). winterrdog provided a Tested ACK."
}

